<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-044" chapter-id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan" source-id="s-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan-ws2027785">
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">年七歲時，母<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p001:m0006" ref="q2g_7m1_cbj">阮淑媛</persName>嘗病危篤，請僧行道。有獻蓮華供佛者，眾僧以銅罌盛水漬其莖，欲華不萎。<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p001:m0043" ref="ltu_nhs_gk6">子懋</persName>流涕禮佛曰：「若使阿姨因此和勝，願諸佛令華竟齋不萎。」七日齋畢，華更鮮紅，視罌中稍有根須，當世稱其孝感。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">母<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p002:m0001" ref="q2g_7m1_cbj">阮</persName>在都，遣書欲密迎上，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p002:m0012" ref="q2g_7m1_cbj">阮</persName>報同產弟<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p002:m0017" ref="rl0_0az_tqc">于瑤之</persName>為計。<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p002:m0023" ref="rl0_0az_tqc">瑤之</persName>馳告明帝</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">中兵參軍<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p003:m0004" ref="obw_yg1_w5i">於琳之</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-044-zimao-ruan:p003:m0008" ref="rl0_0az_tqc">瑤之</persName>兄也</p>
</text>
